OL,3,GNEWSATudor house could be restored
OL,4,Aunder #1.36m plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority is considering
OL,7,Finvesting #1.36m of government funding
OL,8,Fin Margate's Tudor House, one of the
OL,9,Ftown's oldest buildings.
OL,11,FThe Grade II* listed building, which
OL,12,Fdates from 1525, has been vacant since
OL,13,F2022 and has also been damaged by
OL,14,Fvandals.
OL,16,FThanet District Council said the
OL,17,Ffunding could help preserve the
OL,18,Fbuilding, reduce its ongoing costs and
OL,19,Fattract additional investment.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
