OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATudor house could be restored
OL,4,Aunder #1.36m plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuth Duckworth, cabinet member for
OL,7,Fregeneration and property, said the
OL,8,FTudor House was "a unique gem in our
OL,9,Flocal heritage" and residents had made
OL,10,Fclear their desire to see it preserved.
